<title>FRANCE: EU grants free-mkt wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>EU grants free-mkt wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday awarded licences to export 311,300 tonnes of free-market soft wheat at a maximum refund of around 16.50 Ecus per tonne, member country officials said.</p>
<p>It also granted licences to export 268,000 tonnes of free-market barley at a maximum refund of 31.49 Ecus per tonne, they said.</p>
</text>
